Validate historical replay fields before provider conversion.

Base: OpenClaw v2026.8.1 (ea806575e6450e4d1efdfc72c19f04be982a1b9b).
Prevent missing/non-string IDs and text/thinking from throwing before dispatch.
Keep transport-owned parameter handling and legacy result pairing intact.
Emit bounded structural locations without persisting repairs or logging content.
Remove when upstream provides equivalent validation at both replay boundaries.

